%U A400669 0,0,0,1,12,28,32,0,0,0,0,2,9,38,80,128
%N A400669 Triangle read by rows: T(n, k) is the number of self-conjugate edge-connected skew Ferrers diagrams with n cells and k rows. By convention T(0,0) = T(2,0) = T(2,1) = 0.
%C A400669 Equivalently, T(n, k) is the number of self-conjugate parallelogram polyominoes with area n and k X k bounding box.
%H A400669 M. P. Delest and J. M. Fedou, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0012-365X(93)90224-H">Enumeration of skew Ferrers diagrams</a>, Discrete Mathematics, vol. 112 (1993), no. 1-3, pp. 65-79.
%H A400669 Pierre Leroux and Etienne Rassart, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9901135">Enumeration of Symmetry Classes of Parallelogram Polyominoes</a>, arXiv:math/9901135 [math.CO], 1999.
%H A400669 Peter Luschny, <a href="/A400669/a400669.txt">Illustration for A400668 and A400669</a>.
